<figure class="date-zone-diagram" aria-labelledby="date-zone-caption">
  <svg
    class="date-zone-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 900 540"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="date-zone-title date-zone-desc"
  >
    <title id="date-zone-title">台北的一天對應哪段 UTC 時間</title>
    <desc id="date-zone-desc"
      >台北十一月十一日零點至十二日零點，對應 UTC
      十一月十日十六點至十一日十六點。起點包含，終點排除。</desc
    >
    <rect
      class="date-zone-diagram__card"
      x="12"
      y="12"
      width="876"
      height="516"
      rx="18"></rect>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__title" x="40" y="57"
      >查詢日期：2026-11-11 · Asia/Taipei</text
    >
    <rect
      class="date-zone-diagram__range"
      x="40"
      y="90"
      width="820"
      height="130"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__title" x="64" y="126">商店當地時間</text>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="64" y="174">11/11 00:00（含）</text
    >
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="612" y="174"
      >11/12 00:00（不含）</text
    >
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="338" y="260"
      >兩個日界線分別換成 UTC</text
    >
    <rect
      class="date-zone-diagram__range"
      x="40"
      y="294"
      width="820"
      height="130"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__title" x="64" y="330">資料庫查詢範圍</text>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="64" y="378">≥ 11/10 16:00Z</text>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="612" y="378"
      >&lt; 11/11 16:00Z</text
    >
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="40" y="480"
      >相鄰兩天共用日界線，午夜訂單只歸入後一天。</text
    >
  </svg>
  <svg
    class="date-zone-diagram__mobile"
    viewBox="0 0 288 560"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="date-zone-mobile-title date-zone-mobile-desc"
  >
    <title id="date-zone-mobile-title">台北日期與 UTC 區間</title>
    <desc id="date-zone-mobile-desc"
      >桌面圖的直向排列。台北十一月十一日換算後，包含 UTC
      十日十六點，排除十一日十六點。</desc
    >
    <rect
      class="date-zone-diagram__card"
      x="2"
      y="2"
      width="284"
      height="556"
      rx="12"></rect>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__title" x="18" y="36">2026-11-11</text>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="18" y="65"
      >商店時區：Asia/Taipei</text
    >
    <rect
      class="date-zone-diagram__range"
      x="14"
      y="88"
      width="260"
      height="152"
      rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__title" x="28" y="120">商店當地時間</text>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="28" y="160">11/11 00:00（含）</text
    >
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="28" y="203"
      >11/12 00:00（不含）</text
    >
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="28" y="280"
      >兩個日界線分別換成 UTC</text
    >
    <rect
      class="date-zone-diagram__range"
      x="14"
      y="312"
      width="260"
      height="152"
      rx="10"></rect>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__title" x="28" y="344">資料庫查詢範圍</text>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="28" y="384">≥ 11/10 16:00Z</text>
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="28" y="427">&lt; 11/11 16:00Z</text
    >
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="18" y="506"
      >相鄰兩天共用日界線，</text
    >
    <text class="date-zone-diagram__body" x="18" y="535"
      >午夜訂單只歸入後一天。</text
    >
  </svg>
  <figcaption id="date-zone-caption">
    起點包含、終點排除。換算時採用商店時區，與客服所在位置無關。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .date-zone-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  .date-zone-diagram__desktop,
  .date-zone-diagram__mobile {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .date-zone-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
  }
  .date-zone-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }
  .date-zone-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
  }
  .date-zone-diagram__range {
    fill: #eef2ff;
    stroke: #7482b5;
  }
  .date-zone-diagram__title {
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .date-zone-diagram__body {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-size: 19px;
  }
  .date-zone-diagram__mobile .date-zone-diagram__title {
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  .date-zone-diagram__mobile .date-zone-diagram__body {
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .date-zone-diagram__range {
    fill: #252e48;
    stroke: #889bd9;
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .date-zone-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .date-zone-diagram__mobile {
      display: block !important;
    }
  }
</style>
